WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Expansion needs evidence that
the work is useful and repeatable.

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.960
Did the test detect an important fault?

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:08.963
Did reviewers accept the result
without excessive correction?

00:00:09.183 --> 00:00:13.443
Can another engineer reproduce the run
and inspect the original evidence?

00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:18.483
Compare work of similar scope and retain
conventional work as a reference.

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:22.323
Faster text generation alone
does not answer these questions.

00:00:22.463 --> 00:00:24.723
The next investment
should follow demonstrated

00:00:24.803 --> 00:00:27.363
quality and net workflow improvement.
